<title>RUSSIA: Russia T-bills to trade Apr 30 - central bank.</title>
<headline>Russia T-bills to trade Apr 30 - central bank.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Russian Central Bank said secondary trade of Treasury bills and government bonds would be held on Wednesday from 3 p.m. to 4 p.m. (1100 GMT-1200 GMT), in addition to auctions planned for earlier in the day.</p>
<p>T-bills and bonds are not usually traded on Wednesdays, when auctions are held, but Russian markets will be closed May 1-4 and 9-11.</p>
<p>--Anna Smirnova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
